Description: elementary Terminal on Ghostty's terminal engine
 elementary's Terminal with VTE replaced by libghostty-gtk, a GTK4 terminal
 widget on libghostty-vt, Ghostty's terminal engine. The app is elementary's;
 the engine underneath is Ghostty's.
 .
 It replaces io.elementary.terminal, and satisfies what depends on it.
